<SubSection title="Convective Mass Transfer Coefficient" id="ConvectiveMassTransferCoefficient">
<p>The convective mass transfer coefficient <InlineEquation equation="h_{m}" /> <i>includes the effect of both diffusion and bulk flow</i>, and depends on geometry, fluid properties, flow, and concentrations. There are two types of convection:</p>
<Itemize>
	<Item><i>Free</i> convection: driven by a density difference in the fluid due to differences in concentration or temperature</Item>
	<Item><i>Forced</i> convection: driven by an external force such as a fan</Item>
</Itemize>
</SubSection>


